00:55:36.700 --> 00:55:43.010
Mareena Robinson Snowden: be compassionate
with yourself as you build that muscle of

00:55:43.010 --> 00:55:44.320
prioritization and advocacy

00:55:44.320 --> 00:55:49.750
Mareena Robinson Snowden: for yourself. Right.
Because we talked about that tax earlier.

00:55:49.750 --> 00:55:51.990
And oftentimes, when you have

00:55:51.990 --> 00:55:57.250
Mareena Robinson Snowden: so many demands
