00:58:32.470 --> 00:58:38.500
Mareena Robinson Snowden: that. So i'm not
minimizing or dismissing that, but I think

00:58:38.500 --> 00:58:41.050
there's a role for introducing

00:58:41.050 --> 00:58:44.950
Mareena Robinson Snowden: the conversation
in a way that is a little bit further than

00:58:44.950 --> 00:58:46.110
