00:58:46.110 --> 00:58:50.240
Mareena Robinson Snowden: And maybe the way
to approach it if you are in a in a in a more

00:58:50.240 --> 00:58:51.900
risky situation which, let's say you're

00:58:51.900 --> 00:58:55.520
Mareena Robinson Snowden: a graduate student
