00:59:13.520 --> 00:59:18.190
Mareena Robinson Snowden: bring about this?
How might we, right? It's a we thing, but

00:59:18.190 --> 00:59:21.099
in a way that brings in stakeholders

00:59:21.099 --> 00:59:24.570
Mareena Robinson Snowden: from beyond your
