01:00:12.110 --> 01:00:23.040
Shardé Davis: Yes, oh yes risk. Mm hmm. Um,
yeah. And that's a that's an internal conversation

01:00:23.040 --> 01:00:24.040
you have to have with

01:00:24.040 --> 01:00:28.420
Shardé Davis:yourself about if you can do
it, you know. There is something about yeah

01:00:28.420 --> 01:00:29.420
invoking

01:00:29.420 --> 01:00:35.809
Shardé Davis: or kind of, I guess, community.
You're building a coalition nationwide or

01:00:35.809 --> 01:00:36.809
even global-wide with

01:00:36.809 --> 01:00:41.240
Shardé Davis: the other Black graduate students
who likely are experiencing very similar things

01:00:41.240 --> 01:00:45.880
Shardé Davis: or even Black graduate students
