01:01:02.540 --> 01:01:03.540
not attached to an

01:01:03.540 --> 01:01:08.869
Shardé Davis: identity. And let me tell you,
that has shaken UConn like nobody's business

01:01:08.869 --> 01:01:10.300
and I love it.

01:01:10.300 --> 01:01:16.579
Shardé Davis: I love it. I think it's, it
was it's student-created, student ran and

01:01:16.579 --> 01:01:18.110
the university doesn't try to, I mean,

01:01:18.110 --> 01:01:21.380
Shardé Davis: what can they do? It's on a
third-party social media platform. Um, but

01:01:21.380 --> 01:01:23.440
I think it's a really

01:01:23.440 --> 01:01:27.359
Shardé Davis: beautiful way of where students
