01:04:39.860 --> 01:04:47.570
Shardé Davis: the agenda beforehand. Right,
so that they, we all know what it is that

01:04:47.570 --> 01:04:49.280
we plan to speak about

01:04:49.280 --> 01:04:54.640
Shardé Davis: and if I can add just one more
